        <title>PulseBar</title>
        <item>
            <title>0.2.5</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:52:22 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/amer8/pulsebar/main/appcast.xml</link>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>The menu bar warns you when you need to reconnect or sign in again.</li><li>See available DGX system updates in the menu bar. If a check fails, PulseBar marks the last result as out of date.</li><li>The telemetry panel now has a translucent background on supported macOS versions.</li><li>PulseBar sends your sign-in details only to your configured dashboard and rejects invalid session tokens.</li></ul>

]]></description>
