        <item>
            <title>0.2.4</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:33:58 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/amer8/pulsebar/main/appcast.xml</link>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>After repeated connection failures, automatic retries pause until you choose Reconnect, even after an app restart.</li><li>Live readings continue when the dashboard sends an invalid sample.</li><li>Cancelling a connection no longer adds extra delay to the next retry.</li><li>The setup guide now explains the Apple silicon requirement and how PulseBar protects local dashboard connections.</li></ul>

]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/amer8/pulsebar/releases/download/v0.2.4/PulseBar-0.2.4.zip" length="4335494" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="mpf6P63NgcZJfO3fL6og0msBMmIMeZfEwVJRHt5870w2ASzY3GkCtMlJfx+wGHEqCjPtK631HdEGfrTvzpP5Ag=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.2.3</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:39:43 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/amer8/pulsebar/main/appcast.xml</link>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>PulseBar remembers your selected time range and chart scale between launches.</li><li>Hover over a RAM or GPU chart to see a reading and its timestamp.</li><li>About PulseBar and Reconnect are now in the panel’s ··· menu.</li><li>PulseBar handles Keychain errors more reliably when restoring a saved dashboard session.</li></ul>

]]></description>
